            <h1>
              Transform your life
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-lead">
              A journey of self-discovery through Astrology, reflection, and mentorship.
            </p>

            

            <a href="#journey" class="cta-button">
              Begin Your Journey
              <span>→</span>
            </a>

          </div>


          <div class="hero-visual">

            <div class="hero-visual-shape"></div>

            <img
              src="/images/hero.png"
              alt="A contemplative journey toward clarity"
              class="hero-image"
            />

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <!-- ==================================================
           ABOUT
      ================================================== -->

      <section class="about" id="about">

        <div class="section-container about-layout">

          <div class="about-heading">

            <p class="section-label">
              ABOUT SELF ALCHEMY
            </p>

            <h2>
              A Different Approach to Personal Transformation
            </h2>

          </div>

          <div class="about-copy">

            <p class="large-copy">
              Life doesn’t always offer clear answers. Sometimes, we simply need to understand ourselves more deeply
            </p>

            <p>
              Self Alchemy combines Astrology, self-reflection, Life Coaching, and timeless wisdom with practical tools for meaningful transformation
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <!-- ==================================================
           HOW SELF ALCHEMY WORKS
      ================================================== -->

      <section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">

        <div class="section-container">

          <div class="section-intro centered">

            <!-- <p class="section-label">
              HOW SELF ALCHEMY WORKS
            </p> -->

            <h2>
              HOW SELF ALCHEMY WORKS
            </h2>

          </div>


          <div class="how-steps">

            <div class="how-step step-one">

              <div class="step-number">
                1
              </div>

              <h3>
                Look Within
              </h3>

              <p>
                Begin with the questions, experiences, patterns,
                and challenges that brought you here.
              </p>

            </div>


            <div class="how-step step-two">

              <div class="step-number">
                2
              </div>

              <h3>
                Understand
              </h3>

              <p>
                Explore your <strong>core identity, values, beliefs,
                emotional patterns, and astrological blueprint</strong>,
                to understand what may be shaping your career choices
                and relationships.
              </p>

            </div>


            <div class="how-step step-three">

              <div class="step-number">
                3
              </div>

              <h3>
                Transform
              </h3>

              <p>
                Turn awareness into conscious choices through
                practical tools, guided reflection, mentoring,
                and a personalised vision for moving forward.
              </p>

            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="how-statement">

            <span class="statement-mark">“</span>

            <p>
              Self Alchemy is about helping you understand yourself well enough
              to participate consciously in creating a meaningful life
            </p>

            <span class="statement-mark closing-mark">”</span>
            

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


