              <span class="card-number">1</span>
              <h3>Relationships & Marriage</h3>
              <!--<p>
                Understand relationship patterns, emotional triggers,
                compatibility, communication, and the deeper dynamics
                shaping your connection.
              </p> -->

              <p>
                Understand the patterns, emotions, and dynamics shaping your relationships
              </p>
            </article>


            <article class="explore-card">
              <span class="card-number">2</span>
              <h3>Career & Life Direction</h3>
              <!--<p>
                Gain clarity about your strengths, values, natural
                tendencies, professional choices, and the direction
                that feels meaningful to you.
              </p>-->

              <p>
                Gain clarity about your strengths, choices, and meaningful direction
              </p>
            </article>


            <article class="explore-card">
              <span class="card-number">3</span>
              <h3>Major Life Decisions</h3>
              <!--<p>
                When you're standing at a crossroads, gain a deeper
                perspective before making an important decision.
              </p>-->

              <p>
                Gain deeper perspective when facing important choices and turning points
              </p>

            </article>


            <article class="explore-card">
              <span class="card-number">4</span>
              <h3>Personal Growth</h3>
