                Explore your core identity, limiting beliefs, values,
                emotional patterns, and the areas where you are ready
                to grow.
              </p>-->

               <p>
                  Explore your identity, beliefs, values, emotional patterns, and areas for growth
              </p>   
            
            </article>


            <article class="explore-card">
              <span class="card-number">5</span>
              <h3>Purpose & Vision</h3>
              <!--<p>
                Move beyond simply asking <em>"What should I do?"</em>
                and explore <em>"What kind of life do I want to create?"</em>
              </p>-->

              <p>
                Go beyond ‘What should I do?’ to discover ‘What kind of life do I want to create?
              </p>
            </article>


            <article class="explore-card">
              <span class="card-number">6</span>
              <h3>Life Transitions</h3>
