            </div>


            <div class="retreat-themes">

              <h3>
                Our Retreat Themes
              </h3>

              <div class="theme-item">
                <strong>Career & Purpose</strong>
                <span>Understand your strengths, values and direction.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="theme-item">
                <strong>Relationships</strong>
                <span>Explore the patterns that shape how you connect with others.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="theme-item">
                <strong>Marital Harmony</strong>
                <span>Create space to understand, reconnect, and strengthen your relationship.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="theme-item">
                <strong>Personal Transformation</strong>
                <span>Go deeper into identity, beliefs, values, and the life you want to create.</span>
              </div>

            </div>

